ce_sha256":"6d0d990a8b9b7262c27f99cbf280f64969e2bf87a7d83410e1ada4e73ec64cd9","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":17},{"dia_id":"D30:18","global_turn_index":562,"locator":"[S30T18]","raw_turn_sha256":"0d33b6969f30f26221f3484b21cd75867673f59d43b00d07ac9aa9f7d6636f0c","rendered_turn_sha256":"93903ca5fc66f1393cd949d9b5697e4670e937d73832ba642dde79a5b6108a6b","session_date":"2023-11-17","session_datetime":"2023-11-17T10:54:00","session_id":"session_30","session_index":30,"source_sha256":"3aef8baaf0f6655a797b87d5d3c98e239963dcc94f24275d26bf45577ca78cf5","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":18},{"dia_id":"D30:19","global_turn_index":563,"locator":"[S30T19]","raw_turn_sha256":"fc9ffac29316e0119e8bfc4d4382f8b51e1d2e99ce699468c315938622088401","rendered_turn_sha256":"d3409c3c5b5ad2ce128f16214d25059802667ef86a148b8fe79d16a7062bf441","session_date":"2023-11-17","session_datetime":"2023-11-17T10:54:00","session_id":"session_30","session_index":30,"source_sha256":"4949e847084a96b02496b64b34b09f096527a9e8a92fdd65a8aa3b3095a44397","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":19}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-11-17, reconnected with Calvin (\"Hey Calvin, long time no talk! A lot has happened.\") and said he's taken up photography and it's been great — he's been taking pics of the scenery around his area, which is really cool (continuation of the 2023-10-29 thread, see below) [S30T1].\n- On 2023-11-17, shared a photo of a boat floating in the water at sunset (a scenery shot from his new photography hobby) [S30T3]; and, after Calvin told him about his inspiring conversation with an artist at his Boston gala (Calvin's side in the Boston trip and Music sections of /memories/calvin.md), shared his new vintage camera that he bought this month (November 2023) (a photo of a camera sitting on a table next to a plant) — \"which takes awesome photos!\" — Calvin: \"Do you use this camera for photos? They always turn out so good!\"; Dave: yes — \"this camera is very good, it helps me capture those special moments really clearly\" [S30T5][S30T6][S30T7]; Calvin: \"Having a good camera is key for capturing those special moments.\" and asked what Dave likes to take photos of (Calvin's message closed with a photo of a sunset with a wave crashing on rocks); Dave answered in a later message of the same chat (next bullet) [S30T8][S30T9].\n- On 2023-11-17, answering Calvin's question about what he likes to take photos of: being able to take good pics is key, and he loves capturing the beauty of nature — sunsets, beaches, waves — sharing one he got recently (a photo of a sunset with a wave crashing on rocks); Calvin: \"Nice job, Dave! That shot looks great! Nature's so amazing!\" [S30T9][S30T10]. Dave added it's incredible how much emotion and beauty nature can convey through a photo, and agreed with Calvin that nature can boost the spirits in tough times [S30T11][S30T13]; he also shared a picture he snapped the previous week (~2023-11-10/16) — a peaceful scene of a waterfall flowing over rocks and boulders — taken at a serene spot in a nearby park (Calvin: \"Wow Dave, that picture is stunning! Where was that taken? It looks so serene!\"; the park details in ## Parks) [S30T13][S30T14][S30T15].\n- On 2023-11-17, after Calvin closed the nature-photo exchange with a photo he shot in a Japanese garden (a bench under a tree with pink flowers), Dave: \"Cool, Calvin! Found an even better spot, with a bench under a tree with pink flowers - so peaceful. A perfect spot to relax and take in the beauty.\" — describing the same bench-under-a-pink-flower-tree scene as \"a spot\" he found, and Calvin: \"That sounds great, Dave! Can't wait to see it.\" [S30T17][S30T18]; Dave then shared it — \"Check it out, Calvin. It's really calming, I think you'll like it.\" — and the two agreed \"We will definitely go there!\" (a plan to visit the spot together; if it is the same Japanese-garden scene Calvin ph